      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "② 从 L 逆向求 ∂L/∂ŷ\n    链式法则起点，箭头最粗", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
