      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "③ ∂L/∂h = ∂L/∂ŷ · ∂ŷ/∂h\n    链式法则穿过输出层", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
