      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "④ ∂L/∂z = ∂L/∂h · ReLU'(z)\n    穿过激活函数，z≤0 则梯度截断", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
